---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于 | 因特吧">
  <section class="about">
    <div class="unified-page-header">
      <h1>关于我</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <p class="about-bio">
        你好！我是 <strong>zz3656</strong>，一名热爱折腾的开发者。日常活跃在 <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank">Astro</a> 静态站点开发、Linux 系统运维和自动化脚本编写之间，喜欢在开源中寻找解决问题的优雅方案，也乐于把自己的折腾经验写成教程分享出来。目前主营 NAS 折腾、软路由部署、VPS 运维，同时偶尔写点小程序和 AI 工具评测。
      </p>

      <h2>🚀 开源项目</h2>
      <div class="about-projects">
        <div class="project-card">
          <div class="project-emoji">⚡</div>
          <h3>Atom</h3>
          <p>Astro 轻量级博客主题，零 JS 输出，双主题切换，SEO 全内置，1 秒构建。配套 CLI 工具快速创建文章和一键部署。</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/zz3656/Atom" target="_blank" class="tag">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://zz3656.github.io/Atom" target="_blank" class="tag">在线预览</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
          <div class="project-emoji">📊</div>
          <h3>meter-stats</h3>
          <p>轻量级计量统计分析工具，帮助跟踪流量、存储等资源消耗，提供可视化报表和告警通知。</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/zz3656/meter-stats" target="_blank" class="tag">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
          <div class="project-emoji">🎮</div>
          <h3>epic-games-helper</h3>
          <p>Epic Games 平台辅助工具，自动化领取免费游戏，支持库管理和定时提醒。</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/zz3656/epic-games-helper" target="_blank" class="tag">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>📝 关于这个博客</h2>
      <p>这个博客记录了我多年技术折腾和经验沉淀，主要涵盖三个方向：</p>

      <div class="about-topics">
        <div class="topic-card">
          <span class="topic-icon">🖥️</span>
          <div class="topic-info">
            <strong>技术笔记</strong>
            <span>NAS、软路由、VPS 部署运维，从硬件选型到系统调优。</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="topic-card">
          <span class="topic-icon">📖</span>
          <div class="topic-info">
            <strong>生活随笔</strong>
            <span>回忆录系列「我这一生」，记录成长轨迹和生活点滴。</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="topic-card">
          <span class="topic-icon">🤖</span>
          <div class="topic-info">
            <strong>开源探索</strong>
            <span>AI 项目评测、开源工具推荐、自动化脚本分享。</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>🛠️ 技能栈</h2>
      <div class="about-skills">
        <span class="skill-tag">Astro</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Linux</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Shell</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Docker</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Proxmox VE</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">RouterOS</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">TrueNAS</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">OpenWrt</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">GitHub Actions</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Cloudflare</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
      </div>

      <h2>🤝 联系</h2>
      <p>所有项目都在 GitHub 上开源，欢迎 Star、Fork，发现问题随时提 Issue，一起交流！</p>
      <div class="about-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/zz3656" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">🐙 GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/zz3656/Atom" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">⭐ Star Atom</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
